  m_Name: Text_BarnGuard_NightTalk
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Game::Game.Dialogue.TextDialogueNode
  text: Not so loud, friend. A man walks his rounds at night, people get ideas, and ideas get repeated by men who can't count past their fingers. I'd rather that didn't happen to either of us.
